SUMMARY:Quest Lancaster's 50th Anniversary Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the 50th anniversary of Quest Lancaster with educational seminars for intellectually curious lifelong learners on a variety of subjects ranging from history\, science\, world views\, archaeology\, and more during this 6-week program: \n\n\n\nOct. 15 Subjects: \n\n\n\n\nDogwoods that Memorialize the Challenger Disaster with Len Eiserer\, PhD\n\n\n\nConsuming Coffee: The Material Culture of Coffee Consumption with Dr. James A Delle\n\n\n\nThe Outstanding Novels of Irish Writer Sally Rooney with Dr. Roger Godin\n\n\n\nThe Changing Religious Landscape of Lancaster County with Dr. Lee C. Barrett\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/quest-lancasters-50th-anniversary-seminar/
LOCATION:Trinity Lutheran Church\, 31 South Duke Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ORGANIZER;CN="Quest":MAILTO:questlancaster@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
