SUMMARY:Thaddeus Stevens College of Technology Fall 2026 Open House
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to make an impact in your career? Attend the Thaddeus Stevens Fall Open House! Open House offers a unique and engaging in-person opportunity to explore all that Thaddeus Stevens College of Technology has to offer. While visiting us for the Fall Open House\, plan to: – Spend time in your future program of study\, tour our labs\, and talk with faculty– Connect with various support offices– Speak with industry partners regarding the opportunities that await after earning a degree from Thaddeus Stevens College. \n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/thaddeus-stevens-college-of-technology-fall-2026-open-house/
LOCATION:Thaddeus Stevens College of Technology\, 750 E. King St.\, Lancaster\, 17603
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/Facebook-Event-Cover-v1.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Thaddeus Stevens College":MAILTO:info@stevenscollege.edu
END:VEVENT
