SUMMARY:Smartphone Photography Workshop at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is for anyone who has a smartphone with a camera and is looking for tips and resources to be able to take and edit high quality photographs.  This workshop offers hands-on instruction and will dive into creating effective compositions\, lighting\, and basic editing through the camera app on your phone and suggestions for additional apps to explore. Note: This workshop requires you to understand how to find and do basic tasks with the camera on your smartphone.\n\nLearn more at pcad.edu/cce \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/smartphone-photography-workshop-at-pcad/
