SUMMARY:Creative Playground: Playing with Paper: Grades 4-6 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:In this class\, students will have the opportunity to explore open-ended prompts and create paper based art based on their own process. The instructor\, Kerrin Barelli\, will share a variety of techniques with paper as the theme. Students will then have the opportunity to choose a project or idea\, sketch it out\, and experiment with the new paper-based skills they’ve learned. The goal of this workshop is to encourage creative play\, curiosity\, and experimentation! It is perfect for students looking for some creative freedom! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/creative-playground-playing-with-paper-grades-4-6-at-pcad/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania College of Art & Design – Center for Creative Exploration\, 204 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
