SUMMARY:Lancaster Rec's 2026 RECtoberfest
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Rec is hosting the 2026 RECtoberfest at the Conestoga Pines Pool (200 Arthur E Morris Parkway\, Lancaster\, PA 17601). This event is free family event in place to welcome the fall season to the Lancaster community! Within the event we will have a variety of activations for children\, families\, and attendees to enjoy such as live music\, food trucks\, pumpkin launching\, games\, vendors\, crafts\, and a petting zoo! Join us for a wonderful kick-off to the fall season at the Conestoga Pines Pool for our 2026 RECtoberfest! We cannot wait to see you join us for this amazing event! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-recs-2026-rectoberfest/
