SUMMARY:Cirque du Canines
DESCRIPTION:Dancing dogs\, acrobatic trainers\, and heartwarming moments! The collaboration of former Ringling touring performer Gail Mirabella and longtime trick dog performer Michelle Harrell\, Cirque du Canines brings the dynamic dog circus to the stage with frisbee tricks\, high jumps\, dog dancing and agility\, comedy\, and music—and even a live dog painting! A show with something “fur” all ages to enjoy! \n\nAdults $15 | Students $10\n\nFree kids’ activities and crafts in the lobby an hour before showtime! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
