SUMMARY:Rhythm of Life: Healing through Rhythm and Music
DESCRIPTION:Can music help us feel more connected and centered? Join Grammy-winning tabla maestro and Guggenheim Fellow Sandeep Das and bansuri artist Jay Gandhi for an interactive journey into North Indian Classical Music. Explore Indian musical concepts of melody\, rhythm\, spiritual composition\, and disciplined practice while discovering how this centuries-old musical tradition can connect us more deeply to culture\, creativity\, and wellbeing. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/rhythm-of-life-healing-through-rhythm-and-music/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
