SUMMARY:Savage Cabaret: Burlesque Spooktacular!
DESCRIPTION:Savage Cabaret: Burlesque Spooktacular is an intimate night of seductive dance\, twisted comedy\, outrageous costumes and wicked variety.\n\nEnter a haunted world where vintage cabaret glamour collides with Halloween debauchery.\n\nYour Lineup of the Damned features Margot Starlux\, Calamity Chang\, Miss A La Fay\, Jellen and Della Artè\, with Faceless serving as stage kitten and Kate Nyx commanding the evening as host.\n\nReserve a table\, settle in with drinks served right to you by West Art\, and experience the art the way it was intended to be. Dress yourself in whatever makes you feel alive\, step inside the apocalypse and get ready to take a walk on the wild side with Savage Cabaret! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/savage-cabaret-burlesque-spooktacular/
LOCATION:West Art\, 800 Buchanan Ave\, Lancaster PA\, Lancaster\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/SC_Spooky_5x7-JPEG.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Bonafide Ivy":MAILTO:BonafideIvy@GMAIL.com
