SUMMARY:History\, Lore & Trivia with Adam Zurn and Benton Webber
DESCRIPTION:Join Historic Rock Ford as they welcome Adam Zurn and Benton Webber for a fun afternoon of “History\, Lore & Trivia” in the Rock Ford Barn. First\, Adam Zurn of Uncharted Lancaster will present “Legendary Tales from the Mighty Susquehanna River.” After Adam’s presentation\, Benton Webber will host his “Revolutionary Lancaster Quiz Bowl.” Questions and answers will be in a Quiz Bowl format with teams of four being created. The Rock Ford barn will be set up so that guests will pick a table to sit at upon arrival for Adam’s presentation and then those tables of four will become teams for the Quiz Bowl. Meet up with your friends and make a team or join a group at a table and make some new friends! Adam Zurn’s presentation will be from 2 PM to 3 PM followed by Benton Webber’s Quiz Bowl from 3 PM to 4 PM. This event is free with registration required. It will be held in the Langmuir Education Room located on the first floor of the Rock Ford Barn.  \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/history-lore-trivia-with-adam-zurn-and-benton-webber/
LOCATION:Historic Rock Ford\, 881 ROCKFORD RD\, Lancaster\, 17602
CATEGORIES:Community
