SUMMARY:Sandeep Das: Raga\, Rhythm\, & Rasa
DESCRIPTION:Experience the healing power of music with Grammy-winning Tabla maestro and Guggenheim Fellow Sandeep Das. This intimate chamber music concert explores the emotional sentiments of Indian Classical Music known as the Navarasa. Fully relax onstage on a cushion or comfortable chair\, or in our spaced-out auditorium seating\, as you immerse yourself in the mesmerizing dialogue of exotic instruments\, intricate compositions\, expressive phrasing\, spontaneous improvisations\, and joyful folk melodies. \n\nAdults $25 | Students $17 \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/sandeep-das-raga-rhythm-rasa/
