SUMMARY:Pass the Aux
DESCRIPTION:Join us for WORK FLOW\, a showcase highlighting some of the most active and compelling voices in the 717 independent music scene. Part performance and part process breakdown\, the night offers a look into how local artists build their music from the ground up. \n\n\n\nFeatured Artists: \n\n\n\n\nbenOAKS – Independent hip-hop artist\, producer\, and graphic designer. His single “Empathy” (with 66notes) is in national indie and college radio rotation\, with his next single “Fall Down” (ft. Karma Star) dropping October 23 ahead of his upcoming EP.\n\n\n\nCircumstantial Saint (Jontel Toland) – Author\, poet\, spoken word performer\, and host of the monthly Puff & Poet open mic at Hempfield Apothetique.\n\n\n\nKarma Star & GMS – Featured artists on benOAKS’s upcoming EP following their performances at the Indie Artist Workshop showcase.\n\n\n\nthe BJEWELLED – Rounding out the featured showcase with their distinct sound and creative approach.\n\n\n\n\nFormat: \n\n\n\nEach featured artist gets 5 to 10 minutes on stage to dissect their creative workflow before playing a set of their latest or favorite recordings\, beats\, and music. \n\n\n\nIn addition to the featured sets\, the night includes 7 open aux spots and an open cypher running throughout the evening. Emcees\, vocalists\, and poets are encouraged to sign up and take the mic. \n\n\n\nCome connect\, collaborate\, and experience how Lancaster makes music. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/pass-the-aux/
LOCATION:Hempfield Apothetique\, 100 West Walnut Street\, Lancaster\, 17603
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ORGANIZER;CN="PH Makes an F Sound":MAILTO:phmakes@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
