SUMMARY:Beginner Kinusaiga Workshop: Black Cat or Pumpkin
DESCRIPTION:Learn a super fun new hobby while creating a cute Halloween or fall decoration! In this beginner-friendly kinusaiga workshop\, you’ll learn how to tuck and layer fabrics into a foam design to create a festive “no-sew quilt block”. We’ll pre-cut your choice of design (choose between black cat or pumpkin at checkout) into the foam\, so there’s no need for sharp knives—just choose your fabrics\, cut them to fit\, and create!  \n\n\n\nAges 11+ recommended due to the fine motor skills required. Younger children are welcome to participate with a parent’s help! Younger than age 14 must be accompanied by an adult. Minimum of 3 people required for workshop to run. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/beginner-kinusaiga-workshop-black-cat-or-pumpkin/
