SUMMARY:Worldbuilding 101: For Writers at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop geared towards writers\, we will use a variety of creative prompts and games to pull us out of a creative slump! These tools will help you create the framework for worldbuilding for your future writing. We will explore prompts to help understand place and space as well as your characters\, props\, and other things that bring texture and life to a story. This class is perfect for anyone interested in fiction development and the early steps of large scale creative projects. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
