SUMMARY:Worldbuilding 101: Character Design & Visual Language at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Craft your own world\, write your own lore and create visual art to guide your audience through it! Join us as we use creative prompts and games to pull us out of a creative slump! These tools will help you create the work that will serve as the foundation for worldbuilding and explore the intersection of creative writing and visual arts. This class is perfect for anyone interested in visual development and the early steps of large scale artistic projects. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
